    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U02",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "公开课上的夸奖和你心里那股虚，中间好像突然被扯开了一个口子——刚下台就被物业电话拽回家，看到妈妈一个人站在门卫那儿，手里还攥着糖。那一刻你的心疼和慌张，是不是也没来得及被你自己好好接住？",
      "request_sha256": "75fb4cdbcd33a031b439c1d835632d2eda4b8832991b3d68667a6dc30d844f82",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 3942,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 0
        },
        "output_tokens": 314,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 256
        },
        "total_tokens": 4256,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 3942,
            "output_tokens": 314,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 256
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 0
            },
            "total_tokens": 4256,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U03",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，我那天看到我妈攥着糖，第一反应居然是松了口气，至少她没走太远。可等我把她领回家，给她换鞋的时候，手一直在抖，也不知道是跑急了还是怎么的。",
      "request_sha256": "9ff2453e99dd301fe7fd8a6cabecf6cfab9d783b6f399aac2db927c7eb44eaa0",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4679,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 3072
        },
        "output_tokens": 198,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 150
        },
        "total_tokens": 4877,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4679,
            "output_tokens": 198,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 150
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 3072
            },
            "total_tokens": 4877,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U04",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你当时第一反应是松了口气，可换鞋时手却一直抖，好像身体比你的判断更早知道这件事有多重。那种抖也许不只是跑急，还带着后怕——怕她没走远，也怕下一次未必能这么“幸运”。你愿意多说说换鞋时脑子里闪过什么吗？",
      "request_sha256": "997492a49ab6af4d90ddcf34fbdf0a8ff8d35c1fc8ae8648cc958a546100d6d8",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4093,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 3072
        },
        "output_tokens": 319,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 252
        },
        "total_tokens": 4412,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4093,
            "output_tokens": 319,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 252
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 3072
            },
            "total_tokens": 4412,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U05",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，换鞋的时候我脑子里全是她站在门卫那儿的样子，手里那几颗糖都捏出汗来了。我一边给她脱鞋一边想，要是哪天真走远了，我是不是还来得及从讲台上跑回来。",
      "request_sha256": "05709858ea7f60a08ccd4a9dec053fc0c752be86d26dd7f2226fea0408823616",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4839,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 3072
        },
        "output_tokens": 287,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 236
        },
        "total_tokens": 5126,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4839,
            "output_tokens": 287,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 236
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 3072
            },
            "total_tokens": 5126,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U06",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "你好像被夹在讲台和家门之间，一边是别人眼里的“天生适合当老师”，一边是随时可能冲回来的慌乱。那个“还来得及吗”的念头里，是不是也藏着对自己分身乏术的害怕？",
      "request_sha256": "47f974af15898bb5bb695a0f8f91b74a3a8943a6fb17af24b67927186937901b",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4256,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 3072
        },
        "output_tokens": 165,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 114
        },
        "total_tokens": 4421,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4256,
            "output_tokens": 165,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 114
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 3072
            },
            "total_tokens": 4421,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U07",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，我是怕，怕哪天真出了事，我可能要怪自己一辈子。这周我弟本来说周末回来，结果周五晚上又发消息说临时有事不来了，我连生气都没力气，就觉得心里空了一块，夜里还反胃。",
      "request_sha256": "73ce07dce5d0dc86aa6787b6a791082709e0d461d0d3bcb5c04245e7655db203",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4986,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 4096
        },
        "output_tokens": 271,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 215
        },
        "total_tokens": 5257,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4986,
            "output_tokens": 271,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 215
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 4096
            },
            "total_tokens": 5257,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U08",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "弟弟又一次说来又不来，你连生气的力气都没有了，只剩心里空掉一块，夜里还反胃——听起来这种失望和无力已经不再只是情绪，而是落在身体上了。你不需要急着解释反胃，我们可以先停在你“连生气都没力气”这个位置，看看那空掉的地方还连着些什么。",
      "request_sha256": "84f0ebfed2f86817622653cf597e25903dce1a4465428f7c17966204f14f2e8c",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4408,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 4096
        },
        "output_tokens": 270,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 200
        },
        "total_tokens": 4678,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4408,
            "output_tokens": 270,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 200
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 4096
            },
            "total_tokens": 4678,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U09",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，我也说不清空了的那块连着啥，就是这周夜里醒过来，胃里翻得难受，脑子里一遍遍过的是他上个月说“这次肯定回”的那条语音。我现在听见手机响都条件反射地怕，怕又是谁临时变了卦。",
      "request_sha256": "b04a1d41d00a2d2de014a542915ed86ef6c8017c1aa876efa9b93cae4afa9ae0",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 5157,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 4096
        },
        "output_tokens": 568,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 507
        },
        "total_tokens": 5725,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 5157,
            "output_tokens": 568,
