        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U10",
      "role": "counselor",
      "text": "那条“这次肯定回”的语音，现在好像和夜里翻胃的感觉黏在一起，反复在你身体里转。手机一响就条件反射地怕，或许是因为你已经被“临时变卦”晃过太多次，连安心等一个消息都觉得危险。",
      "request_sha256": "5cb215b269f6502cdc15f30b452489e2827e893e37146d9ac1f9d0d5cf098524",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 4584,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 4096
        },
        "output_tokens": 353,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 296
        },
        "total_tokens": 4937,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 4584,
            "output_tokens": 353,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 296
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 4096
            },
            "total_tokens": 4937,
            "x_billing_type": "response_api"
          }
        ]
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "P06-S04-U11",
      "role": "client",
      "text": "其实吧，我现在最怕的就是手机响，尤其是半夜。昨天我点开过一个照顾记性变差老人的家属群，看了半天又退出来了，觉得自己还没到要找人搭话的地步，也不想让别人知道我家这样。",
      "request_sha256": "bac0446ccb6d427924485b3c3f749ebf34e60af60a7627c5a2fc4dd15af7ade4",
      "usage": {
        "input_tokens": 5327,
        "input_tokens_details": {
          "cached_tokens": 4096
        },
        "output_tokens": 621,
        "output_tokens_details": {
          "reasoning_tokens": 572
        },
        "total_tokens": 5948,
        "x_details": [
          {
            "input_tokens": 5327,
            "output_tokens": 621,
            "output_tokens_details": {
              "reasoning_tokens": 572
            },
            "prompt_tokens_details": {
              "cached_tokens": 4096
